{{Quote|Can you ever forgive me, Padmé?''"<br />"''It is the Republic that should be asking your forgiveness, my old friend. Far too often we forget that our most important allies are not always the most powerful.|Onaconda Farr and Padmé Amidala|audio=ForgiveMePadme-BJ.flac|<ref name="Bombad Jedi" />}}
The '''Mission to Rodia''', also known as the '''Capture of Nute Gunray''' or the '''rescue of Senator Padmé Amidala''', was a mission to the [[planet]] [[Rodia]] that took place during the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="Bombad Jedi" />

{{Mission-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The Mission to Rodia made its first appearance in the opening narration of "[[Ambush]],"<ref name="Ambush">{{TCW|Ambush}}</ref> the premiere episode of the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' television series, which first aired on [[October 3]], [[2008]].<ref name="Ambush Ep Guide">{{SWArchive|url=theclonewars/guide/episode001.html|text=''The Clone Wars'' Episode Guide: Ambush}}</ref> The mission made its first proper appearance in the later episode "[[Bombad Jedi]]."<ref name="Bombad Jedi" /> It was first identified in the [[2015]] reference book ''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''.<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref>

The [[2018]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: The Complete Visual Dictionary, New Edition]]'' stated that [[Onaconda Farr]] renounced his [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist]] allies a short [[time]] after he started working with them.<ref name="CVD">''[[Star Wars: The Complete Visual Dictionary, New Edition]]''</ref> However, the [[2019]] [[Fantasy Flight Games]] sourcebook ''[[Rise of the Separatists]]'' states that Farr's deal with the Separatists lasted for nearly a [[Standard year|year]] into the war.<ref name="Rise">''[[Rise of the Separatists]]''</ref> As ''Rise of the Separatists'' contradicts this and later sources, this article assumes ''The Complete Visual Dictionary'' is correct.

